About the role
At SDE3 level, the engineer operates with a high degree of autonomy and is accountable for delivering complex software systems end to end. This role requires deep technical expertise across UI, backend, and infrastructure, with ownership extending beyond delivery into production stability and long‐term maintainability. The engineer is a trusted technical leader whose judgment influences architectural decisions and team standards. 
You will be responsible for

- Owns the end‐to‐end delivery of complex software solutions, from problem definition and design through to production support. 

- Designs and builds scalable, high‐quality user interfaces using React. js, ensuring performance, accessibility, and consistency. 

- Designs, develops, and operates backend services using Node. js, with a strong focus on reliability, security, and maintainability. 

- Makes and owns architectural decisions across frontend, backend, and infrastructure, balancing technical excellence with business outcomes. 

- Owns cloud infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, deployments, monitoring, and operational readiness of services in production. 

- Drives engineering quality through appropriate use of automated testing at unit, integration, and end‐to‐end levels. 

- Raises the technical bar through code reviews, mentoring, and influencing engineering practices across the team. 

You will need

- Strong, hands‐on experience building production UI applications using React. js. 

- Strong backend engineering experience with Node. js and modern API design. 

- Proven track record of delivering full‐stack systems independently. 

- Hands‐on experience with cloud platforms, CI/CD, and production operations. 

- Experience operating effectively in agile environments and ambiguous problem spaces. 

Operational Skills Relevant for This Job

- UI architecture, state management, and performance optimisation

- Backend service design and API development

- Cloud infrastructure and DevOps practices

- Automated testing strategies

- Technical problem solving and decision‐making

- Technical leadership and mentoring

